{"5112500":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Before I Turn: Survival Auto Battler","steam_appid":5112500,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/3dba5b69e99c19b4145f8358bbc37441.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/3dba5b69e99c19b4145f8358bbc37441.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/3dba5b69e99c19b4145f8358bbc37441.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You were bitten on the first day of the outbreak. Time is running out to stop yourself from turning. You are alone in the lab, and you have to make the antiviral that saves you, and humanity with you.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/0ed99fac5b0d54ee6e737e0528345daa.avif?t=1793725301\" width=900 height=306 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect samples<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streak samples from your own blood and from whatever you bring back from the field. Flame the loop, then draw the streaks across the plate with your own hand. A clean streak means a colony you can actually read.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/800eb47ff56d20be3b53d705622820d0.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras_big\/800eb47ff56d20be3b53d705622820d0.avif?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=530 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Identify the virus<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the colony under the microscope and work out its traits one by one. A wrong diagnosis does not stop you. It just makes you build the wrong cure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/6fc2bd5f0bd3c2425c1640efa013b63b.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras_big\/6fc2bd5f0bd3c2425c1640efa013b63b.avif?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=530 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop the cure<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix reagents at the bench and synthesize your own core molecule, modules and syringes. Every correct diagnosis unlocks a new recipe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/b9148cfe412eb1d46a3ed031e48147c8.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1264 height=652 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trial, Error, Victory!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your antiviral into the machine and watch the fight play out under the microscope. Every defeat teaches you something, and every victory teaches the virus something. Do not stop until you have the final vaccine.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/e060f515fd5a32b7b351fffe8b7dffb1.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras_big\/e060f515fd5a32b7b351fffe8b7dffb1.avif?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=530 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay alive<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not work hungry or sleepless. Tired hands shake, and a shaking hand means a ruined streak and a missed injection.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/3dba5b69e99c19b4145f8358bbc37441.poster.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/3dba5b69e99c19b4145f8358bbc37441.webm?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/3dba5b69e99c19b4145f8358bbc37441.mp4?t=1793725301\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You were bitten on the first day of the outbreak. Time is running out to stop yourself from turning. You are alone in the lab, and you have to make the antiviral that saves you, and humanity with you.<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/0ed99fac5b0d54ee6e737e0528345daa.avif?t=1793725301\" width=900 height=306 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect samples<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streak samples from your own blood and from whatever you bring back from the field. Flame the loop, then draw the streaks across the plate with your own hand. A clean streak means a colony you can actually read.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/800eb47ff56d20be3b53d705622820d0.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras_big\/800eb47ff56d20be3b53d705622820d0.avif?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=530 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Identify the virus<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the colony under the microscope and work out its traits one by one. A wrong diagnosis does not stop you. It just makes you build the wrong cure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/6fc2bd5f0bd3c2425c1640efa013b63b.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras_big\/6fc2bd5f0bd3c2425c1640efa013b63b.avif?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=530 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop the cure<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix reagents at the bench and synthesize your own core molecule, modules and syringes. Every correct diagnosis unlocks a new recipe.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/b9148cfe412eb1d46a3ed031e48147c8.avif?t=1793725301\" width=1264 height=652 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trial, Error, Victory!<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load your antiviral into the machine and watch the fight play out under the microscope. Every defeat teaches you something, and every victory teaches the virus something. Do not stop until you have the final vaccine.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras\/e060f515fd5a32b7b351fffe8b7dffb1.avif?t=1793725301\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/extras_big\/e060f515fd5a32b7b351fffe8b7dffb1.avif?t=1793725301 width=1560 height=530 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay alive<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not work hungry or sleepless. Tired hands shake, and a shaking hand means a ruined streak and a missed injection.<\/p>","short_description":"You've been bitten. Five days before you turn. Swab your own wound, identify the virus under the microscope, synthesize a vaccine and inject yourself. But every cure teaches the virus something new. A survival lab sim where your antivirals fight it out as an auto battler.","supported_languages":"English, Turkish, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Polish, Spanish - Spain","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/28e63fd4e250c2080e119abd93fed5280ff8e2f2\/header.jpg?t=1793725301","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/63ddf6a3365f9369cb71312f1bec4941b00d19ac\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725301","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5112500\/63ddf6a3365f9369cb71312f1bec4941b00d19ac\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725301","website":"https:\/\/bit.fragilent.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64 Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> i5 3550 \/ RYZEN 5 2500X<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong>  NVIDIA GTX 1050 \/ AMD R9 270X<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["fragilent"],"publishers":["Fragilent"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":779,"final":623,"discount_percent":20,"initial_formatted":"7,79€","final_formatted":"6,23€"},"packages":[1770870],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Before I Turn: Survival Auto Battler","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1770870,"percent_savings_text":"-2